title: "PredANN++: Code for Expectation and Acoustic Neural Network Representations Enhance Music Identification from Brain Activity"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Source code for the PredANN++ pipeline for EEG-based music
  identification using acoustic, surprisal, and entropy teacher
  representations.
